# Might of the Meek: target creature gains trample, gets +1/+0 because Bot1 controls a Mouse (Firdoch Core is every creature
# type, so it is a Mouse even though it is not a creature, CR 702.73a), and Bot1 draws a card. Bot1 casts the Core on turn 1
# with Sol Ring and Mox Ruby; on turn 3 (draw: Swamp) Might is paid with Mox Ruby. Hand: Swamp, then Swamp drawn, then the
# card drawn by the spell = 3.

